            "title_highlight_color": "#6D388B",
            "text": "<p>We redesigned the sofa experience around real homes.</p><ul><li><strong>Compressed, roll-packed foam</strong> to save space and reduce shipping costs<br/></li><li><strong>Sofa in a box</strong> packaging that fits through doors and lifts<br/></li><li><strong>Modular designs</strong> for simple, stress-free setup<br/></li><li><strong>Customisation options</strong> because no two homes are the same<br/></li></ul><p>Everything is designed to feel lighter, simpler, and more flexible.</p>",
